  "description": "Gyeong Gi-Do is the new owner of the \"Grand Sauna.\" How hard can running a sauna be for a talented Wall Street trader? \n\nWhat Gi-Do doesn't know is that this sauna has been the \"gay hot spot\" for years. Gi-Do is sick and tired of getting hit on and having to stop customers' indecent behaviors every day.\n\nBut one day, Seo I-Rak, an old regular of the sauna shows up, and Gi-Do ends up having a steamy one-night stand in the sauna...\n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS, edited)",
